"Dr Arun Mohanraj FRCA EDRA, Consultant Anaesthetist, Wrightington, Wigan and Leigh NHS Foundation Trust, with colleagues across the region.": ["Dr Arun Mohanraj FRCA EDRA, anesthésiste consultant, Wrightington, Wigan and Leigh NHS Foundation Trust, avec des collègues de toute la région.", "Dr Arun Mohanraj FRCA EDRA, anestesiólogo consultor, Wrightington, Wigan and Leigh NHS Foundation Trust, con colegas de toda la región.", "Dr Arun Mohanraj FRCA EDRA, Facharzt für Anästhesie (Consultant), Wrightington, Wigan and Leigh NHS Foundation Trust, mit Kolleginnen und Kollegen aus der Region.", "Dr Arun Mohanraj FRCA EDRA, anestesista consulente, Wrightington, Wigan and Leigh NHS Foundation Trust, con colleghi di tutta la regione.", "Dr Arun Mohanraj FRCA EDRA, Uzman Anestezist, Wrightington, Wigan and Leigh NHS Foundation Trust, bölgedeki meslektaşlarıyla birlikte.", "Dr Arun Mohanraj FRCA EDRA, överläkare i anestesi, Wrightington, Wigan and Leigh NHS Foundation Trust, tillsammans med kollegor i regionen.", "Dr Arun Mohanraj FRCA EDRA, ஆலோசக மயக்கவியல் நிபுணர், Wrightington, Wigan and Leigh NHS Foundation Trust, இப்பகுதியின் சக மருத்துவர்களுடன்."],
